      "side": 1,
      "message": "If a lock reclaim comes in with NSM state 0, if the client subsequently restarts and sends SM_NOTIFY, how do we distinguish those reclaimed locks?",
      "revId": "01d3fe99ddfcf7f20cbfcf70364e42658fb222cb",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
